```

## Shared providers and independent diagnostics

Navigation uses the complete captured projection and safe location mapper. Signature
labels and UTF-16 parameter offsets are bounded before conversion. Resolve retains
raw completion data privately and copies only untrusted documentation and detail.

Background diagnostics debounce source inputs independently of editor focus. They
share transport sessions and the serialization gate, yielding to queued typing.
The diagnostics controller owns push versions, asynchronous pull cancellation and
unversioned-report policy. Resource opt-out clears problems without disabling sync
for interactive features. No generation, file writes or workspace edits occur.
